{"video_id":"W3ha2lLyLhc","title":"Peter Steinberger - No Doors for Agents","conference":"berkeley-agentic-ai-summit","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1383,"segments":[{"start":2.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"Don't worry. I I won't make you do"},{"start":4.68,"duration":4.28,"text":"exercises."},{"start":7.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"This week my"},{"start":8.96,"duration":4.64,"text":"my agent attended a meeting."},{"start":11.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"It has its own account."},{"start":13.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"It's own web browser."},{"start":16.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"It listens to system audio."},{"start":18.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"It went disguised as a human."},{"start":21.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"Because in 2026"},{"start":23.92,"duration":2.92,"text":"there are no doors"},{"start":25.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"for agents."},{"start":26.84,"duration":6.0,"text":"Hi, I'm Peter. I built Open Claw and"},{"start":29.52,"duration":5.92,"text":"today I'm I'm wearing my claw hat."},{"start":32.84,"duration":5.28,"text":"Not my Open AI one. I want to talk about"},{"start":35.44,"duration":2.68,"text":"the doors."},{"start":38.48,"duration":3.88,"text":"My vision"},{"start":39.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"hasn't changed since November. An agent"},{"start":42.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"that's always on,"},{"start":44.6,"duration":3.64,"text":"always thinking."},{"start":46.2,"duration":5.0,"text":"It hides complexity."},{"start":48.24,"duration":6.04,"text":"It makes my life easier."},{"start":51.2,"duration":4.6,"text":"And to be up front, today my agent still"},{"start":54.28,"duration":2.96,"text":"sometimes stops. You know, software is"},{"start":55.8,"duration":2.6,"text":"still hard."},{"start":57.24,"duration":2.72,"text":"But I've lived a year in the middle of"},{"start":58.4,"duration":4.44,"text":"this and I"},{"start":59.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"can tell you what I see."},{"start":62.84,"duration":3.2,"text":"Now,"},{"start":64.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"if I look in this room,"},{"start":66.04,"duration":5.28,"text":"you're probably the furthest along"},{"start":68.88,"duration":4.6,"text":"in the world of AI"},{"start":71.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"and agents."},{"start":73.48,"duration":5.4,"text":"My non-technical friends, they use AI,"},{"start":76.68,"duration":3.8,"text":"but they kind of use it like Google."},{"start":78.88,"duration":3.72,"text":"You know, you type in a question into a"},{"start":80.48,"duration":4.48,"text":"box."},{"start":82.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"The text comes back."},{"start":84.96,"duration":5.92,"text":"You know what that reminds me of?"},{"start":87.6,"duration":7.24,"text":"When television was new,"},{"start":90.88,"duration":6.08,"text":"they put those radio shows on the TV."},{"start":94.84,"duration":5.88,"text":"You know, literally you you had people"},{"start":96.96,"duration":4.96,"text":"on TV reading the radio script because"},{"start":100.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"nobody"},{"start":101.92,"duration":5.12,"text":"nobody really understood this new medium"},{"start":104.68,"duration":2.36,"text":"yet."},{"start":107.68,"duration":2.96,"text":"Every new medium"},{"start":109.4,"duration":3.36,"text":"starts"},{"start":110.64,"duration":3.64,"text":"by imitating the old one."},{"start":112.76,"duration":7.32,"text":"The text box"},{"start":114.28,"duration":5.8,"text":"is AI's radio on TV face."},{"start":124.2,"duration":2.68,"text":"Here we go."},{"start":127.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"And"},{"start":128.04,"duration":6.56,"text":"to be fair, it made AI usable"},{"start":131.48,"duration":5.04,"text":"for a billion people."},{"start":134.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"We are humans. We are more expressive"},{"start":136.52,"duration":4.4,"text":"than a text box."},{"start":138.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"We see, we talk,"},{"start":140.92,"duration":2.68,"text":"we hear,"},{"start":142.12,"duration":3.56,"text":"we feel."},{"start":143.6,"duration":4.24,"text":"That's not the final form."},{"start":145.68,"duration":5.16,"text":"And we don't get to the final form"},{"start":147.84,"duration":7.12,"text":"without trying a lot of things. I get my"},{"start":150.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"best ideas when I play with technology."},{"start":154.96,"duration":4.0,"text":"And look at look at"},{"start":157.48,"duration":3.92,"text":"all the"},{"start":158.96,"duration":4.6,"text":"form factors"},{"start":161.4,"duration":4.68,"text":"we tried."},{"start":163.56,"duration":4.96,"text":"The whole agent wave started in the"},{"start":166.08,"duration":5.32,"text":"terminal of all places. And I love the"},{"start":168.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"terminal, but most people never opened"},{"start":171.4,"duration":4.88,"text":"one."},{"start":172.56,"duration":5.76,"text":"Okay. The super app then."},{"start":176.28,"duration":3.88,"text":"Why is it an app?"},{"start":178.32,"duration":4.16,"text":"Or should it be an operating system, you"},{"start":180.16,"duration":3.68,"text":"know, agent OS?"},{"start":182.48,"duration":4.0,"text":"That sounds great, but then you think"},{"start":183.84,"duration":4.64,"text":"about kernels are real and there's"},{"start":186.48,"duration":3.96,"text":"always going to be legacy app. So, the"},{"start":188.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"industry sidebar"},{"start":190.44,"duration":4.92,"text":"industry's answer is sidebars. Every"},{"start":193.32,"duration":4.24,"text":"product has a sidebar"},{"start":195.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"with an agent in it."},{"start":197.56,"duration":4.48,"text":"I don't want the Gemini sidebar in in in"},{"start":199.84,"duration":4.92,"text":"Gmail. The agent knows nothing about the"},{"start":202.04,"duration":4.92,"text":"rest of my system and it's not something"},{"start":204.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"I control."},{"start":206.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"Maybe the best agents are invisible."},{"start":210.84,"duration":4.48,"text":"Always in the background"},{"start":212.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"and I can invoke it anywhere."},{"start":215.32,"duration":4.4,"text":"And gives me the space"},{"start":217.36,"duration":6.48,"text":"to still be human. Cuz sometimes I just"},{"start":219.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"want to open a document and type."},{"start":224.6,"duration":4.08,"text":"Now,"},{"start":225.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"where I want to go with this?"},{"start":228.68,"duration":3.52,"text":"I want it to be a little bit like"},{"start":230.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"Jarvis,"},{"start":232.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"honestly."},{"start":234.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"It shouldn't matter"},{"start":236.56,"duration":2.92,"text":"which room I'm in."},{"start":239.52,"duration":4.12,"text":"It knows the device in my home"},{"start":241.76,"duration":4.4,"text":"and can use them."},{"start":243.64,"duration":4.52,"text":"It knows which computer I'm on"},{"start":246.16,"duration":5.08,"text":"and it can take over the screen"},{"start":248.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"when the job needs hands."},{"start":251.24,"duration":4.32,"text":"On my wrist, I have the watch."},{"start":253.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"Through glasses,"},{"start":255.56,"duration":5.52,"text":"it could see what I see."},{"start":258.6,"duration":5.64,"text":"And we're building the pieces."},{"start":261.08,"duration":3.16,"text":"We have browser use."},{"start":264.52,"duration":4.52,"text":"We have computer use."},{"start":267.0,"duration":3.96,"text":"We have canvas."},{"start":269.04,"duration":4.68,"text":"We have now these amazing voice models"},{"start":270.96,"duration":4.88,"text":"that can talk and listen"},{"start":273.72,"duration":4.28,"text":"at the same time."},{"start":275.84,"duration":4.08,"text":"And we have video. It's not really"},{"start":278.0,"duration":3.8,"text":"real-time yet, but you know, we'll get"},{"start":279.92,"duration":3.04,"text":"there."},{"start":281.8,"duration":3.24,"text":"It should be like a person that's"},{"start":282.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"sitting next to me."},{"start":285.04,"duration":5.0,"text":"And I know I shouldn't say person."},{"start":287.68,"duration":3.68,"text":"An agent really is a tool."},{"start":290.04,"duration":5.04,"text":"But it"},{"start":291.36,"duration":3.72,"text":"it feels like a very magical tool."},{"start":298.32,"duration":3.28,"text":"So, back to that meeting from the"},{"start":300.28,"duration":3.24,"text":"beginning."},{"start":301.6,"duration":2.8,"text":"Why the disguise?"},{"start":303.52,"duration":2.6,"text":"Getting"},{"start":304.4,"duration":3.52,"text":"notes out"},{"start":306.12,"duration":4.08,"text":"is easy. That's solved. There's a"},{"start":307.92,"duration":3.12,"text":"thousand products that do that."},{"start":310.2,"duration":4.88,"text":"But"},{"start":311.04,"duration":5.28,"text":"actually being in the room is"},{"start":315.08,"duration":2.8,"text":"what's hard."},{"start":316.32,"duration":4.6,"text":"What has no door."},{"start":317.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"And it's not just the platforms."},{"start":320.92,"duration":3.24,"text":"To give my agent"},{"start":322.64,"duration":3.28,"text":"a voice,"},{"start":324.16,"duration":4.36,"text":"the setup is actually an audio driver"},{"start":325.92,"duration":5.04,"text":"that pipes sound through it. And the"},{"start":328.52,"duration":4.8,"text":"install instruction literally say"},{"start":330.96,"duration":4.88,"text":"you have to reboot."},{"start":333.32,"duration":4.44,"text":"Even the operating system"},{"start":335.84,"duration":4.8,"text":"has no doors"},{"start":337.76,"duration":2.88,"text":"for agents yet."},{"start":343.52,"duration":4.2,"text":"So, here's what I want my agent to do."},{"start":346.0,"duration":3.56,"text":"We're discussing something."},{"start":347.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"Nobody knows the answer. My agent"},{"start":349.56,"duration":4.52,"text":"noticed and it spins off a copy of"},{"start":352.44,"duration":4.76,"text":"itself"},{"start":354.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"while it stays in the conversation"},{"start":357.2,"duration":2.56,"text":"because the harness is just software in"},{"start":358.64,"duration":2.76,"text":"a way, right?"},{"start":359.76,"duration":5.16,"text":"And the agent can clone itself. It never"},{"start":361.4,"duration":5.32,"text":"has to choose between listening"},{"start":364.92,"duration":3.36,"text":"and working. And when the answer comes"},{"start":366.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"back,"},{"start":368.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"it doesn't interrupt. It waits"},{"start":370.92,"duration":4.24,"text":"for the moment that fits. It joins the"},{"start":373.12,"duration":3.84,"text":"conversation."},{"start":375.16,"duration":2.92,"text":"I think that would be very natural."},{"start":376.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"That's what a"},{"start":378.08,"duration":3.6,"text":"colleague would do."},{"start":384.0,"duration":3.04,"text":"Now,"},{"start":384.96,"duration":3.76,"text":"people ask me"},{"start":387.04,"duration":4.04,"text":"is this talk about agents or is it about"},{"start":388.72,"duration":4.4,"text":"software?"},{"start":391.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"How's it not really the same thing?"},{"start":393.12,"duration":4.0,"text":"I built a lot of little tools."},{"start":395.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"And the joke is I I built most of the"},{"start":397.12,"duration":5.8,"text":"tools for my agent,"},{"start":399.88,"duration":6.12,"text":"which means I built it for myself"},{"start":402.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"because data gets more interesting when"},{"start":406.0,"duration":3.64,"text":"you combine it."},{"start":407.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"Discord tells me"},{"start":409.64,"duration":4.04,"text":"which feature people love."},{"start":411.84,"duration":4.0,"text":"GitHub tells me"},{"start":413.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"where things break."},{"start":415.84,"duration":3.96,"text":"And GitHub has a good API,"},{"start":418.2,"duration":3.0,"text":"but it's built"},{"start":419.8,"duration":5.68,"text":"for humans."},{"start":421.2,"duration":6.52,"text":"At agent scale, it breaks."},{"start":425.48,"duration":4.8,"text":"So, I built a tool and now my agent has"},{"start":427.72,"duration":5.88,"text":"full text search over I looked this up"},{"start":430.28,"duration":5.64,"text":"110,000 issues and PRs"},{"start":433.6,"duration":3.96,"text":"locally. And you know, Twitter Twitter"},{"start":435.92,"duration":2.88,"text":"is actually fair. You can export your"},{"start":437.56,"duration":3.6,"text":"archive,"},{"start":438.8,"duration":4.92,"text":"but it's a mountain of JSON. So, I built"},{"start":441.16,"duration":4.88,"text":"a tool for that, too."},{"start":443.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"And one I really love"},{"start":446.04,"duration":4.4,"text":"I really loved"},{"start":447.92,"duration":5.28,"text":"recently moved his keys somewhere"},{"start":450.44,"duration":4.16,"text":"my agents can't follow."},{"start":453.2,"duration":3.32,"text":"And what does that actually What they"},{"start":454.6,"duration":3.48,"text":"actually achieved is that"},{"start":456.52,"duration":3.68,"text":"it just takes a little longer for my"},{"start":458.08,"duration":5.8,"text":"agent to get out the data"},{"start":460.2,"duration":3.68,"text":"and it motivates me to build my own."},{"start":465.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"On legs this year,"},{"start":467.68,"duration":4.2,"text":"I predicted that"},{"start":469.36,"duration":4.96,"text":"80% of the apps would disappear. And"},{"start":471.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"maybe the truth is actually simpler."},{"start":474.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"Maybe people replace them."},{"start":477.12,"duration":5.36,"text":"Someone asked Claude to build a CLI for"},{"start":480.08,"duration":5.0,"text":"his Samsung surround system. It rooted"},{"start":482.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"the phone, it installed SmartThings, it"},{"start":485.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"reverse engineered the app,"},{"start":487.32,"duration":7.4,"text":"and it extracted every hidden control."},{"start":489.64,"duration":5.08,"text":"He just wanted to turn the volume down."},{"start":495.4,"duration":3.84,"text":"Another guy pointed Codex at his studio"},{"start":498.2,"duration":3.48,"text":"lights."},{"start":499.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"It told him which dev board to buy,"},{"start":501.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"and two days later, he has an"},{"start":503.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"open-source controller. His words,"},{"start":506.16,"duration":3.76,"text":"\"I have no idea what it's doing, but"},{"start":507.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"it's doing a great job.\""},{"start":509.92,"duration":6.8,"text":"You know, close source, open source,"},{"start":512.84,"duration":6.44,"text":"nothing stops a determined human with an"},{"start":516.72,"duration":5.16,"text":"agent."},{"start":519.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"And it gets recursive."},{"start":521.88,"duration":4.72,"text":"We build software with agents, we build"},{"start":524.32,"duration":4.6,"text":"agents with agents. We wrote the first"},{"start":526.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"agent by hand, and now agents build"},{"start":528.92,"duration":5.56,"text":"agents and software is agents. What are"},{"start":531.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"we even building? I don't know."},{"start":534.48,"duration":3.36,"text":"What I do know,"},{"start":535.88,"duration":3.68,"text":"the small ones"},{"start":537.84,"duration":3.52,"text":"fit in a session."},{"start":539.56,"duration":3.48,"text":"The big ones might get their own"},{"start":541.36,"duration":4.72,"text":"factory."},{"start":543.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"And the factory experience are starting"},{"start":546.08,"duration":6.6,"text":"to actually work."},{"start":548.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"You know, compilers took a while, too."},{"start":555.48,"duration":3.56,"text":"Now,"},{"start":556.68,"duration":4.8,"text":"the question that"},{"start":559.04,"duration":4.28,"text":"everyone is polite enough to ask, an"},{"start":561.48,"duration":3.32,"text":"agent that's always there, always"},{"start":563.32,"duration":3.08,"text":"listening,"},{"start":564.8,"duration":4.88,"text":"isn't that creepy?"},{"start":566.4,"duration":4.28,"text":"Well, maybe if it's not yours."},{"start":569.68,"duration":2.64,"text":"You know,"},{"start":570.68,"duration":3.52,"text":"the thing holds my memories. I'm I'm"},{"start":572.32,"duration":4.6,"text":"very European at heart."},{"start":574.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"I want to know where my memories are."},{"start":576.92,"duration":3.72,"text":"So, my agent"},{"start":578.56,"duration":5.64,"text":"runs on my hardware. Or maybe it runs in"},{"start":580.64,"duration":4.88,"text":"a box in a cloud that I have the keys."},{"start":584.2,"duration":3.52,"text":"And I can pick"},{"start":585.52,"duration":4.92,"text":"a model per task. You know, building"},{"start":587.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"software, I want the frontier."},{"start":590.44,"duration":3.92,"text":"Something personal,"},{"start":592.08,"duration":3.32,"text":"maybe this is better with a local model"},{"start":594.36,"duration":2.72,"text":"that never"},{"start":595.4,"duration":3.84,"text":"leaves the room."},{"start":597.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"You have the hardware,"},{"start":599.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"you run open weights."},{"start":601.44,"duration":3.72,"text":"You don't,"},{"start":602.84,"duration":3.88,"text":"you pick a provider you trust."},{"start":605.16,"duration":2.56,"text":"It's about choice."},{"start":606.72,"duration":2.64,"text":"That's why"},{"start":607.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"Open Claw lives in a"},{"start":609.36,"duration":3.08,"text":"nonprofit foundation."},{"start":612.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"We're trying to do the right thing"},{"start":615.4,"duration":3.2,"text":"and give people that choice."},{"start":623.0,"duration":2.88,"text":"Now, in February,"},{"start":626.56,"duration":6.32,"text":"ClawCon happened in San Francisco."},{"start":630.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"A conference about my project,"},{"start":632.88,"duration":4.24,"text":"and I didn't organize it, you know, I"},{"start":634.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"was a guest. And the room was full of"},{"start":637.12,"duration":2.72,"text":"builders."},{"start":638.84,"duration":2.76,"text":"People"},{"start":639.84,"duration":3.4,"text":"were so excited."},{"start":641.6,"duration":3.88,"text":"AI suddenly was something they could"},{"start":643.24,"duration":5.04,"text":"own, they could change."},{"start":645.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"It felt like theirs. That's the future I"},{"start":648.28,"duration":3.8,"text":"want."},{"start":649.8,"duration":4.68,"text":"Doesn't need to be for everyone."},{"start":652.08,"duration":4.0,"text":"The people"},{"start":654.48,"duration":3.08,"text":"for for it"},{"start":656.08,"duration":3.84,"text":"are going to love it."},{"start":657.56,"duration":4.8,"text":"I'm one of them."},{"start":659.92,"duration":4.12,"text":"There are still no doors for agents, and"},{"start":662.36,"duration":3.36,"text":"that's good."},{"start":664.04,"duration":3.52,"text":"Because building doors"},{"start":665.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"is the fun part."},{"start":667.56,"duration":2.4,"text":"Thank you."}]}